Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:24:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Virtual 0015: macdrv-desktops-overlay

Only the input desktop's windows are visible (SwitchDesktop reaches all
processes); kiosk desktops and borderless full-screen windows float
above normal Mac apps, shrinkable with Virtual's shortcut

Ported onto CrossOver's Mac driver: window style masks are merged with
CrossOver's own macdrv_GetWindowStyleMasks changes (replaces 0019).
